source:
Beyond Darkness is kind of different from my other games, because it has drama and romance.
But of course it still does have mystery elements and some creepy moments. So if you don't like the first part, I hope you at least finish the game because things do change ^^;;

[From [url=https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/634116]Newgrounds[/url]]

translation:
《Beyond Darkness》与我的其他作品有些不同，因为它融入了戏剧冲突与恋爱元素。
当然，游戏中依然保留了悬疑推理要素与几分阴森诡谲的桥段。所以哪怕你不太喜欢前半部分，也希望你至少能玩到最后，因为后续的展开绝对会峰回路转^^;;

[摘自[url=https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/634116]Newgrounds[/url]]
